# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) only if you need a local override.
# Only EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables are embedded into the client bundle. They must NEVER be secrets.
# AutoKeep is local-first (ADR-0023): there is no backend, so no backend URL or key exists.

# Shows the clearly labeled prototype data instead of the on-device database (demo builds only).
# EXPO_PUBLIC_DEMO_DATA=1
